  "resume": "This is a 2007 Swiss TV news report from Schweizer Fernsehen DRS covering the Green Party's assessment of the outgoing legislative period. It includes statements by Green Party National Council members Therese Frösch and Ueli Leuenberger, footage of a Green Party poster on climate change, and a shot of Christoph Blocher walking through a corridor. The report also shows a session of Green Party deputies."
